  "content_html": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiKU7Rz15-OBLVdXYoxmQBL4PIVo2XxmDo8t4QmSG6VhrjnCe4wR5wu44VPLE_LK7bo8yg1cOxA3HadCNKC1RYV_v_UxEYc9xiksHbm7UL_htdE15YGiOWG8Sjxh6a8l6468uiyG0HWVHH1wPl5RBdg2RiTr9okhLc_0N4n6Yhyphenhyphen0VNV8oNGT-6Wz4NgP58/s1024/DALL%C2%B7E%202025-03-26%2022.05.06%20-%20A%20wacky%20cartoon%20illustration%20of%20a%20keychain%20featuring%20absurd%20and%20unrelated%20items_%20an%20artificial%20tooth,%20two%20screws,%20a%20tiny%20roll%20of%20toilet%20paper,%20and%20a%20m.webp\"><img alt=\"מחזיק מפתחות רב תכליתי: כולל נייר טואלט, שיניים להחלפה וסט ברגים\" border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiKU7Rz15-OBLVdXYoxmQBL4PIVo2XxmDo8t4QmSG6VhrjnCe4wR5wu44VPLE_LK7bo8yg1cOxA3HadCNKC1RYV_v_UxEYc9xiksHbm7UL_htdE15YGiOWG8Sjxh6a8l6468uiyG0HWVHH1wPl5RBdg2RiTr9okhLc_0N4n6Yhyphenhyphen0VNV8oNGT-6Wz4NgP58/w320-h320/DALL%C2%B7E%202025-03-26%2022.05.06%20-%20A%20wacky%20cartoon%20illustration%20of%20a%20keychain%20featuring%20absurd%20and%20unrelated%20items_%20an%20artificial%20tooth,%20two%20screws,%20a%20tiny%20roll%20of%20toilet%20paper,%20and%20a%20m.webp\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">למכירה: החיים בגרסת&nbsp;בַּאנְדֶּל</span></h2><blockquote style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲשֶׁר תֵּאָפֶה בַּתַּנּוּר</span></blockquote><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הַיּוֹם, בְּכָל בּוּפֶה,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לֹא מְגַלִּים חֶמְלָה.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כִּי 'קָפֶה וּמַאֲפֶה',<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">נִמְכָּרִים בַּחֲבִילָה.</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span>אוֹמְרִים - שֶׁהָרִאשׁוֹן,<br />הָיָה אָדוֹן מַנְדֵּל.<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הַמְּשַׁוֵּק הַגָּאוֹן,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">שֶׁהִמְצִיא אֶת הַבַּנְדֶּל.</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הוּא בָּא בְּהַצָּעָה,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לְיַצֵּר פַּטִּישׁ נַגָּרִים,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">שֶׁצִּדּוֹ הָאֶחָד - הַכָּאָה,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בַּשֵּׁנִי - עוֹקְרִים מַסְמְרִים.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בַּהֶמְשֵׁךְ הוּא מָכַר,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מַחְזִיק מַפְתְּחוֹת.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">עִם פּוֹתְחַן בַּקְבּוּק קַר,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">פְּלוּס שֶׁבַע פְּצִירוֹת.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מִשָּׁם, זֶה הָיָה,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">עִנְיָן שֶׁל יָמִים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">שֶׁהַשִּׁיטָה חָדְרָה,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לְכָל הַתְּחוּמִים.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְכָךְ, בְּיוֹם בָּהִיר,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">נוֹלְדוּ הַחֲבִילוֹת.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וּלְכָל עוֹסֵק זָעִיר,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">זִנֵּק גְּרַף הַמְּכִירוֹת.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בְּמִשְׂרְדֵי תַּיָּרוּת,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">תִּמְצְאוּ חֲבִילוֹת נוֹפׇשִׁים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֵצֶל סַפָּקֵי שֵׁרוּת,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">תַּשְׁתִּית פְּלוּס סִיבִים.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">חֲבִילָה חַשְׁמַלִּית,<br />לְחָתָן וּלְכַלָּה.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">חֲבִילַת לֵדָה,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לָאִשָּׁה הֶהָרָה.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">\"חֲבִילַת רִילוֹקֶיְשֶׁן\",<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מֻצַּעַת לְכָל מְהַגֵּר.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֶפְשָׁר לְהַזְמִין בְּשֵׁיְן,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אִם אַתָּה מְמַהֵר.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲפִלּוּ נַעֲלַיִם,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מוֹכְרִים רַק בְּזוּגוֹת.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וּלְכָל זוּג אוֹפַנַּיִם,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">צֶמֶד דְּוָשׁוֹת.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">- חַמִּין, בָּא עִם צָרֶבֶת,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">- תַּרְגּוּם, עִם שֵׁרוּתֵי תִּמְלוּל.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">- יוֹנִים נִמְשָׁכוֹת לְצַהֶבֶת.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">- מַמָּשׁ הַכֹּל כָּלוּל.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הִצִּיעוּ לָהּ חָתָן,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">שֶׁהוּא כְּלִיל הַמַּעֲלוֹת.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">קְצָת נָמוּךְ - שְׁמַנְמַן,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בְּחִיר עוֹלַם הַיְּשִׁיבוֹת.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְלִי הִצִּיעוּ שִׁדּוּךְ,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בַּחוּרָה עִם אַרְבָּעָה חֲדָרִים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">דָּחִיתִי, כִּי זֶה שִׁינְמוּך,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לָגוּר בָּרְכָסִים...</span></span></p>"
